  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your elemental and energetic power erupts with a mighty surge.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Elemental Boost<sup>CAF</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The effects of this feat apply to spell-like abilities and effects created by magic items that you wield or activate as well as spells and supernatural abilities. In addition, you can choose a number of additional energy descriptors from those listed equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1); the effects of this feat apply to all of your chosen energy types. When you roll damage for an effect you create (including with a magic item) using your chosen energy type, you may expend one use of mythic power as a free action to reroll damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc118\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
